mdpage 1.1 pctl: page 1's register 2 on PHY 0 against page 0's (the scan's a00 r2 001C)
pctl pr a0 p1 r02 v 001C p0 0 ps 1 p1 0 rs 0 rc 0
pctl blind yes: page 1's register 2 reads page 0's 001C, so a PHY left on page 1 reads the same registers 0-5 and the scan rows and lde cannot see it (P7, P8, section 7)
